OL,3,AGCSE grade gap between boys and girls
OL,4,Ashrinks to lowest since 2000, as
OL,5,Astudents open their results
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe GCSE overall pass rate has fallen
OL,8,Fslightly for the fifth year in a row -
OL,9,Fbut top grades have edged up across
OL,10,FEngland, Wales and Northern Ireland
OL,12,FThe gap between the pass rates for boys
OL,13,Fand girls across all three nations has
OL,14,Fnarrowed again, to its lowest point
OL,15,Fsince 2000
OL,17,FHundreds of thousands of students are
OL,18,Fopening their GCSE, BTec and Cambridge
OL,19,FNationals results - you can watch live
OL,20,Fat the top of the page
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
