OL,3,AGCSE grade gap between boys and girls
OL,4,Ashrinks to lowest since 2000, as
OL,5,Astudents open their results
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrom 11:00 BST, some pupils in England
OL,8,Fcan check their grades via an app for
OL,9,Fthe first time
OL,11,FAt one school in Derby, it's confetti,
OL,12,Fcheers and happy tears as students
OL,13,Freceive their results, while aspiring
OL,14,Fdancer Finn "can't believe" he's
OL,15,F"passed everything"
OL,17,FNot everyone getting their grades is a
OL,18,Fteenager, as 52-year-old grandmother
OL,19,FWynne is "shocked" but "very happy" to
OL,20,Fhave passed her maths exam at the fifth
OL,21,Fattempt
